  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 21–25</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Choose the correct answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Assignment on multinational companies</h4><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">21</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">The tutor points out to Lara that in different markets, a brand of chocolate</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 21, has different proportions of the ingredients.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>has different proportions of the ingredients.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 21, uses different methods of advertising.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>uses different methods of advertising.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 21, is sold at different prices.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>is sold at different prices.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">22</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Which aim of global marketing has Lara explained very clearly?</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 22, making profit\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>making profit</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 22, maximising sales\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>maximising sales</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 22, expanding production\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>expanding production</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">23</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">The tutor gives the example of the supermarket chain to show how companies</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 23, can use new advertising methods to bring new business.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>can use new advertising methods to bring new business.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 23, may fail to take local values into consideration.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>may fail to take local values into consideration.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 23, need time to build up their reputation.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>need time to build up their reputation.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">24</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Lara believes that some multinational companies can be criticised for</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 24, offering poor working conditions locally.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>offering poor working conditions locally.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 24, failing to improve machinery.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>failing to improve machinery.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 24, replacing local managers.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>replacing local managers.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">25</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Which aspect of distribution does Lara want to read about?</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 25, delivery times\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>delivery times</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 25, stock control\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>stock control</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 25, centralisation\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>centralisation</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 26–30</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Which topic can be found in each of the following case studies? Choose five answers from the list and move each answer into the correct gap.</p><div class=\"match-layout\"><div><h4>Case studies</h4><div class=\"form-row \">Drummonds <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q26\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"26\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 26, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">26</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">Multiplan <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q27\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"27\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 27, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">27</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">Elbeys <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q28\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"28\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 28